<title>USA: BioWhittaker Inc Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>BioWhittaker Inc Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>WALKERSVILLE, Md. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			For the Three Months  For the Twelve Months</p>
<p>				 Ended October 31,  Ended October 31,</p>
<p>					1996    1995	 1996    1995</p>
